  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Save the Shea-nut tree campaign</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to plant 15,000 Sheanut trees/Vitellaria Paradoxa  (locally called EKUNGUR) across Katakwi district by end of 2022. This will improve the health, incomes and nutrition of the local communities. Shea nut butter has varied uses including preventing sun burns, fighting fungal infections, promoting growth of new cells, and helping soothe conditions like eczema, dermatitis, and psoriasis.</narrative>
  </description>
